      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T14:24:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed that reaped sessions are skipped once expiry runs. Could we increment the batch counter for every session visited, including those for which `sfdp_expire_session_now()` returns 0 because `expiry_pending` is set? This would bound active session visits per call without needing a cursor. Consecutive calls might temporarily make no progress while expiry is pending, but they would progress once expiry removes those sessions.",
      "parentUuid": "62b347d1_278d45dc",
